# cappu Android 12 migration note: platform policy now declares and labels the
# source-built hostapd service as hal_wifi_hostapd_default. The old MTK policy
# referred to an undeclared `hostapd` domain and attached both supplicant and
# MTK HIDL server roles to it, which would duplicate the current HAL policy.
# Keep this file as documentation only; the platform service owns those rules.

